# Beacon API - Model Routing Cost and Latency Benchmark Matrix
**Author:** Zed Fontaine  
**Department:** Research  
**Project:** Beacon API  
**Produced:** D13 03:35  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Cost-latency trade-off analysis and dynamic routing configuration for Beacon API, benchmarked against internal budget constraints specified in the Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
